title: The whole file is staged, then the removal of "line 8" is unstaged alone; committed and the rest discarded, the file must be the four new lines and lines 1 to 12 in order
folders: git-shifted
expect-file: git-shifted/delete.txt :: ^// one\n// two\n// three\n// four\nline 1\nline 2\nline 3\nline 4\nline 5\nline 6\nline 7\nline 8\nline 9\nline 10\nline 11\nline 12\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto delete.txt
wait 1000
git stage delete.txt
wait 1500
part unstage delete.txt 12
wait 1500
mark unstaged
wait 600
git commit the four lines only
wait 1500
git discard delete.txt
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
